<title>BELGIUM: EU to amend rice supply aid regulation.</title>
<headline>EU to amend rice supply aid regulation.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's cereals and rice management committee will amend on Thursday the draft regulation on aid for the supply of rice to the so-called Poseidom countries, an EU offcial said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The draft regulation (980/92) covering supplies to Guyana, Martinique and Guadaloupe has been delayed because the committee was waiting for France to supply figures.</p>
<p>An amendment is now expected at Thursday's meeting,&quot; the offcial said.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
